### 查询资产（默认第一页）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assets

### 按科室+状态筛选
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assets?dept=信息科&status=RUNNING

### 新增资产
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetCode": "ZC-0021",
  "name": "测试打印机",
  "category": "PRINTER",
  "dept": "信息科",
  "location": "行政楼4层",
  "criticalLevel": 3,
  "owner": "吴涛"
}